#{[17592186483213 #edb/ref 1080 "30" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483213 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483213 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "ef86a85c-17ca-562f-9487-9b3559e88804" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483293 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186482930 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483293 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186483127 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483293 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186483132 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483293 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186483178 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483293 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186483213 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483293 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483293 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483293 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186483127 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483293 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "899b1e4d-10a7-5a27-99db-9badc378d5e8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483324 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186482833 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483324 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186482883 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483324 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186482967 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483324 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186483032 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483324 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186483193 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483324 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483324 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483324 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186483032 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483324 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "d7bebbb6-2b2e-5637-b8dd-0175f7869ed4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483406 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186483293 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483406 #edb/ref 1069 "q-81312" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483406 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483406 #edb/ref 1071 "${\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{{y}^{3}}^{{y}^{2}}(y-1)\\,dx\\,dy=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483406 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "c2f72ec4-b491-5de0-a559-269634816f5a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483406 #edb/ref 1074 "The integral is defined over a type II region.\n\nFirst, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{{y}^{3}}^{{y}^{2}}(y-1)\\,dx\\,dy & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(y-1)[{\\int }_{{y}^{3}}^{{y}^{2}}\\,dx]\\,dy \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(y-1)\\,[x]_{{y}^{3}}^{{y}^{2}}\\,dy \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(y-1)({y}^{2}-{y}^{3})\\,dy \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(-{y}^{4}+2{y}^{3}-{y}^{2})\\,dy\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}(-{y}^{4}+2{y}^{3}-{y}^{2})\\,dy & ={[-\\frac{{y}^{5}}{5}+\\frac{{y}^{4}}{2}-\\frac{{y}^{3}}{3}]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{5}+\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{3} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{30}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483413 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186483324 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483413 #edb/ref 1069 "q-81301" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483413 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483413 #edb/ref 1071 "![](images/c3/c3dbd6e26cb67b2f247387c30e03296f790c3f56c03779a7dda5ae5d0b081958.png)\n\nIf $D$ is the finite region enclosed by the lines $x=3-{y}^{3},\\,$ $x={y}^{3},$ and $y=0,$ as shown above, then ${∬}_{D}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{xy}}\\,dA=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483413 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "cf43c215-ffc3-5823-9335-496b6c1fd83f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483413 #edb/ref 1074 "First, let's represent $D$ as a type II region. \n\n- To determine the $y$-limits, we need to find the $y$-coordinates of the points at which the curves intersect. So, we set the following equation and solve it for $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3-{y}^{3} & ={y}^{3} \\\\ 2{y}^{3} & =3 \\\\ {y}^{3} & =\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ y & =\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{3}{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, $y$-limits are \n$0\\le y\\le \\sqrt[3]{\\frac{3}{2}}.$\n\n- To determine the left and right functions, we draw a horizontal arrow from left to right through the region, as usual.\n\n![](images/36/366146b42d476b8d2a467e607a3bba1ef65ddc8a344b3f0e17ee4652ccc0463a.png)\n\nAs a result, we get\n\n$$\nD=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le y\\le \\sqrt[3]{\\frac{3}{2}},\\,{y}^{3}\\le x\\le 3-{y}^{3}\\}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can express the integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{xy}}\\,dA & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt[3]{3/2}}{\\int }_{{y}^{3}}^{3-{y}^{3}}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{xy}}\\,dx\\,dy \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt[3]{3/2}}[{\\int }_{{y}^{3}}^{3-{y}^{3}}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{xy}}\\,dx]dy\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483448 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186483494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483448 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "2afa0257-b116-5a6a-9b0d-60d7a1cd57fb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483448 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186483406 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483482 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186483448 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483482 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "9ace463d-182e-59e5-aeba-5e1e35ffd968" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483482 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186483413 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483490 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186483482 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483490 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "b77fee23-8b22-50d7-96e8-1c58b86a3b31" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483490 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186134306 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483494 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186483497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483494 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "c80c8b7b-b893-5376-b09c-6e111f90842a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483494 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186351288 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483497 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "d0735f10-459e-5cba-a81d-a0fc2a9e4e82" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483497 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186268871 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
